                <pb facs="0178" n="60" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg60"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adams to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 19,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Letter foreign minister announcing formation government. Treaties intact.
                    Requesting relations continue. Await instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adams.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
